&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At euNetworks, Finance plays a critical role in supporting strategic decision-making, driving commercial performance and enabling sustainable business growth. As a leading European provider of high-capacity fibre network infrastructure and Data Centre to Data Centre connectivity, euNetworks operates in a dynamic, investment-intensive market where robust financial planning and analysis are essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;euNetworks is seeking a commercially-minded Senior Director of Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis to lead financial planning, forecasting, performance reporting and business partnering across the business. Reporting directly to the Chief Financial Officer, this role will take ownership of monthly financial reporting and deliver high-quality financial insights to the Board and ExCo to shape strategy and drive performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with commercial and operational stakeholders, the Senior Director will act as a trusted business partner, translating financial data into actionable insights that support revenue growth, cost management and investment decisions. The role will also work closely with Business Operations to strengthen commercial performance analysis, forecasting and alignment between financial plans and sales objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity for an experienced finance leader with a strong commercial finance background to influence business strategy and drive financial performance across a growing European digital infrastructure business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the FP&amp;amp;A function, overseeing financial planning, budgeting, forecasting and performance analysis across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop and motivate a high-performing FP&amp;amp;A team, setting clear objectives and building the capability needed to support the business&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the monthly financial reporting process, ensuring accurate, timely and insightful reporting of financial performance against budget, forecast and prior periods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse financial results, identify key trends and variances, and provide recommendations to improve business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously enhance financial models, reporting processes and analytical tools to improve the quality and efficiency of financial decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Board &amp;amp; ExCo Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the preparation and delivery of financial reporting and performance analysis for the Board and ExCo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex financial information into clear, concise insights, highlighting key business drivers, risks, opportunities and recommended actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support senior leadership with financial analysis for strategic initiatives, investment decisions and business planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistency, accuracy and alignment across management reporting, financial forecasts and executive presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Finance &amp;amp; Business Partnering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted finance partner to senior stakeholders, providing commercial insight and constructive challenge to support business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate revenue performance, margins, operating costs and investment priorities to identify opportunities for growth and improved profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with functional leaders to assess financial performance, challenge assumptions and ensure accountability against agreed business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business strategy into financial plans, performance measures and actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; Financial Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development and ongoing management of financial forecasts, budgets and long-range financial plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate forecasting activities across relevant business functions, ensuring assumptions reflect commercial priorities and operational requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess forecast accuracy, identify emerging risks and opportunities, and recommend appropriate corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scenario analyses and financial models to support strategic planning, investment decisions and business performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Operations &amp;amp; Commercial Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Business Operations to align financial forecasts with sales pipelines, revenue expectations and commercial targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide financial analysis of sales performance, customer revenue, pipeline conversion and commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of reporting and analytical tools that improve visibility of sales performance and revenue trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales and Commercial teams to strengthen forecasting accuracy, performance accountability and alignment between sales plans and financial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we want &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;from &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading FP&amp;amp;A commercial finance functions, ideally within a complex, international B2B business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A recognised professional accounting qualification (e.g. ACA, ACCA, CIMA) or equivalent preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong commercial finance background, with a proven ability to translate financial data into actionable business insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning monthly management reporting, budgeting, forecasting and financial performance analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience preparing financial reports and presentations for Board and ExCo audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable business partnering experience, including the ability to challenge and influence senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with Business Operations or commercial teams to support revenue forecasting, pipeline analysis and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial modelling, analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to interpret complex data and identify business trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication and presentation skills, with the ability to explain financial performance and recommendations clearly to non-finance stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership, organisational and project management skills, with the ability to manage competing priorities and deliver to tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in financial planning, reporting and analytical systems, alongside strong Excel and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, commercially-minded and collaborative approach, with a strong focus on accuracy, accountability and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Telecommunications, Digital Infrastructure, Technology or another capital-intensive industry would be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this position is of interest but you don’t think you meet all of the criteria listed, please still consider applying. euNetworks looks to recruit people with the right attitude, potential and ambition and for the right candidate, we will provide further training and support to enable you to develop in the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can we offer you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At euNetworks we invest in our people by offering a range of benefits and development opportunities designed to support your professional growth and personal wellbeing. Employees have access to a comprehensive wellbeing programme that promotes mental health and also recognises the importance of work-life balance through initiatives such as a dedicated birthday day off and “give back” days to support volunteering activities. euNetworks’ bonus scheme is linked to both individual contribution and overall company performance with opportunity to overachieve in both areas. In addition, euNetworks operates a flexible hybrid working policy, enabling employees to balance in-office collaboration with remote work, fostering productivity, autonomy and a positive employee experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Family Friendly Policy delivers enhanced and inclusive parental benefits that can viewed &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1yM2VvLsByNiULKnRX9pIksCK0GI6FmO2/edit?usp=sharing&amp;amp;ouid=105588911760161167743&amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;sd=true&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Insurances, pensions, leave and additional enhancements are modelled to work with local country provisions, please email &lt;a ---------- for more details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our company values drive our behaviour and form the basis of how we operate our business. We work as a team promoting a culture of collaboration, trust and respect where every individual is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer and commit to providing each individual with the support, continued learning and the tools to achieve their goals and an environment in which they can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to make the hiring process equitable and accessible for all. Providing candidates with the opportunity to be their true selves and explore how you might thrive at euNetworks. We are a recognised Disability Confident employer and will make provisions where possible to support you through the interview process, if you require any reasonable accommodation through the selection process, please let your Talent Partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;euNetworks is a pan-European provider of bandwidth infrastructure services and a vital enabler of Cloud and AI adoption. We’re the leading connectivity partner for data centre companies and their customers in Europe, directly connecting over 600 data centres today. We own and operate 18 metropolitan city networks connected with a high capacity intercity backbone covering 53 cities in 17 countries. A leading provider of cloud connectivity, we&amp;nbsp;directly connect to all major cloud platforms.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;For clarity and accessibility, we have chosen not to use gender-neutral or inclusive writing conventions in our communications. WPP Media is firmly committed to diversity: we value inclusion and equality, considering all candidates regardless of gender identity, ethnic origin, or religion. All our positions are also open to people with disabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is a creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build a better future for our people, our planet, our clients, and our communities. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a id=&quot;menur2aq&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://wpp.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;wpp.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s global media network. In a world where media is omnipresent, we bring together the best platform, the best talent, and the best partners to develop the most innovative solutions, delivering unparalleled growth for our clients. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a id=&quot;menur2as&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://wppmedia.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It is through this synergy that we deliver truly exceptional experiences, for both our clients and our internal teams. To succeed in this role, it is crucial to embody the core values that unite WPP and WPP Media:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by fostering collective leadership that inspires truly transformative creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by finding the perfect balance between the fulfillment of our people and the satisfaction of our clients, all built on mutual trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Optimism&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by actively stimulating growth and development to mobilize our entire organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About EssenceMediacom&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EssenceMediacom represents a new approach to the media agency. Our expertise is based on in-depth data analysis and a keen understanding of consumer behavior, combined with the most advanced technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are convinced that the strategic alliance between media and creativity can radically transform the performance of the biggest brands. Our role is to support our clients in understanding the complex challenges of contemporary marketing and to identify the levers of innovation that will enable them to create lasting connections with their consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our organizational structure reflects this modern vision: we combine intelligent data utilization with a human-centered approach, we cultivate diversity of perspectives and expertise, and we favor a continuous, large-scale experimentation and learning approach. Above all, we have integrated adaptability into our DNA to continuously evolve with market transformations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Analytics Manager – Europe&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;will be a crucial member of our client-focused team for the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Europe region&lt;/strong&gt;, responsible for assisting in the planning, execution, and optimization of European digital acquisition campaigns and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;analyzing cross-media results on all European campaigns&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our luxury sector client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a blend of strategic thinking, advanced analytical prowess, and strong collaborative skills to evaluate multi-channel performance, ensure consistent brand adherence across European markets, and drive knowledge sharing across international teams. You will play a key role in measuring media efficiency, driving brand visibility, and optimizing customer acquisition across all media channels in Europe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;European Campaign Planning &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Assist in the planning, coordination, and execution of regional digital acquisition campaigns (Paid Search, Paid Social, Display, Programmatic, etc.) across European markets, ensuring strict alignment with the client&#39;s global strategy and European brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Media Analytics &amp;amp; Performance Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lead the comprehensive analysis and evaluation of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;cross-media results across all European campaigns&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(combining digital, offline, print, broadcast, and programmatic channels). Identify cross-channel synergies, key trends, and actionable data insights to maximize overall media ROI across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Market Collaboration &amp;amp; Knowledge Sharing:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Actively liaise with local European market teams to facilitate the exchange of performance insights, cross-media learnings, and best practices, fostering a connected and high-performing European network. Participate in regional and global team calls and knowledge-sharing sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Assurance &amp;amp; Analytics Governance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Support the implementation and adherence to European performance marketing and measurement guidelines, ensuring data integrity, tracking accuracy, and operational consistency across all regional campaign activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;European Market Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Stay abreast of European media trends, cross-media measurement innovations, platform updates (e.g., Google, Meta, programmatic platforms, local European media networks), and regulatory frameworks (e.g., GDPR, ePrivacy directives), sharing relevant implications with regional and local teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;3–5 years of proven experience in media planning, buying, and cross-media performance analytics, either agency-side or client-side, with a strong focus on performance marketing.&amp;nbsp;Experience working across European markets is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fluency in French is essential, alongside business proficiency in English.&amp;nbsp;Proficiency in other European languages is a significant advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Demonstrated expertise across digital acquisition channels (Paid Search, Paid Social, Display, Programmatic) and modern cross-media analytics platforms and tracking tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Data Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Advanced ability to work with complex numerical datasets, analyze cross-media campaign performance, isolate channel impact, and distill complex data into clear, strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Capable of managing multiple European campaigns and analytics projects simultaneously, prioritizing tasks effectively in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interpersonal &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Dynamic with excellent communication and client service skills, capable of collaborating effectively across multi-cultural European teams and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-Solving &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proactive approach to identifying performance bottlenecks and an aptitude for leveraging media data to propose innovative cross-channel solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attitude:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Enthusiastic, with a strong willingness to learn, adapt, and drive growth in the luxury sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Exhibits strong team spirit, thoroughness, and attention to detail in all tasks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media and its Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to shaping the future of media is manifested by active support for the professional development of our talents, helping them reach their full potential. This approach is accompanied by a responsible vision in our media investment strategies, thus reflecting our dual priority: valuing our employees while adopting sustainable practices in our sector. WPP Media employees have privileged access to WPP Media&#39;s and WPP&#39;s international networks, allowing them to develop their passions, expand their professional network, and stay at the forefront of innovations in marketing and advertising.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have vast and varied resources available to our employees; our company actively cultivates the inclusion of talents from all backgrounds. The successes and expertise of the teams are regularly highlighted during unifying events that also punctuate key moments of the year, thus strengthening our collaborative and diverse corporate culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote work:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;up to 2 days per week and 2 full weeks to be taken twice a year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Two additional days off offered&lt;/strong&gt;, including Whit Monday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional leave days&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;based on seniority in 5-year increments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5 additional remote work days per month&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for employees suffering from endometriosis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability policy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;3 paid authorized absence days per year, access to Chèques Emploi Service Universel (CESU), and specific support for employees with a RQTH (Recognition of Disabled Worker Status).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solidarity missions&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;possible via the &quot;We care and we act&quot; program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview with the recruitment team:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A first phone or video conference interview with a member of our recruitment team to review your background, discuss your experience with European campaign management and analytics, and address your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational interview:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;An interview with the Luxury Client Team lead to assess your technical, analytical, and management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Case study:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A practical case study focused on cross-media campaign analysis and strategy within the European market, followed by a debriefing session.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to making this process as fast and efficient as possible, and to maintaining open and transparent communication throughout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;WPP Media guarantees equal opportunities and considers all candidates without discrimination or consideration of particular characteristics. We are committed to cultivating an environment of respect where everyone feels at home and benefits from the same opportunities for professional development.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Consult our privacy policy to learn all about the protection of your data. Although we review all applications received, we only contact those selected for an interview.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En bref&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Chez Picnic, tout commence dans l&#39;application : c&#39;est là que se joue l&#39;expérience de nos clients avec notre supermarché en ligne. La homepage est le premier écran que nos clients voient à chaque ouverture de l&#39;app, et ils l&#39;ouvrent en moyenne &lt;strong&gt;6 fois par commande&lt;/strong&gt;. C&#39;est notre point de contact le plus stratégique : à la fois notre principal levier de conversion immédiate, et l&#39;endroit où se construit la perception de marque sur le long terme.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;En tant qu&#39;&lt;strong&gt;In-app Campaign Owner&lt;/strong&gt;, tu portes la responsabilité éditoriale de cette page à fort enjeu, ainsi que le déploiement de l&#39;ensemble des campagnes in-app qui s&#39;y jouent : des lancements de produits aux grandes opérations saisonnières. Avec un espace à l&#39;écran limité, chaque décision de priorisation compte : tu arbitres en permanence entre ce qui convertit maintenant et ce qui inspire et fidélise sur la durée, en t&#39;appuyant sur les tests A/B autant que sur ton expérience et ton intuition quand les données ne tranchent pas clairement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Tu définis le contenu éditorial hebdomadaire, coordonnes son exécution avec les équipes Design, Copy, Category Management et Tech, et mesures l&#39;impact de chaque campagne sur le trafic et les ventes. Chacune de tes décisions est visible immédiatement par nos clients et contribue directement à leur satisfaction et à nos objectifs commerciaux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/6TXqRcPPJM4&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilité de la page d’accueil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Tu arbitres, sur un espace à l&#39;écran limité, entre les offres qui répondent aux besoins immédiats des clients et celles qui construisent la perception de marque sur le long terme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Création et planification des campagnes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Tu intègres dynamiques de marché, priorités commerciales et identité de la marque Picnic pour conceptualiser et planifier des campagnes qui activent nos clients et boostent les ventes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordination et pilotage des équipes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Tu coordonnes l&#39;exécution de tes campagnes sur l&#39;ensemble des canaux (app, mails, push, socials, etc.) et pilotes le travail des équipes Design, Copywriting, Marketing, Category Management et Trading, souvent sans lien hiérarchique direct, ce qui demande une vraie capacité à faire avancer les sujets par l&#39;influence et la conviction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compréhension des clients et de la marque &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Tu comprends les besoins des clients et le marché (notamment grâce à des entretiens clients) afin de garantir une expérience sur l’application qui offre pleinement satisfaction tout en réalisant nos objectifs stratégiques courts et longs termes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Suivi des performances commerciales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Tu suis les indicateurs commerciaux et opérationnels (trafic, ventes, marge…) et réalises des tests A/B pour piloter tes décisions par la donnée. Tu sais aussi mobiliser ton expérience et ton discernement business pour avancer, dans une logique d&#39;amélioration continue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos de toi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es diplômé·e d’un Master en Marketing, Business, Communication ou domaine connexe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as entre 3 et 5 ans d’expérience à temps plein dans un rôle lié à la gestion d’un produit digital, d’une plateforme e-commerce ou d’une expérience in-app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as évolué dans un environnement exigeant et hands-on : startup, scale-up ou organisation avec un fort niveau d’autonomie et de responsabilité. Tu es à l’aise dans des environnements rapides et opérationnels, où les décisions ont un impact visible immédiatement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as déjà piloté des campagnes ou projets créatifs impliquant de multiples stakeholders (Design, Copy, Business, Tech, agences, etc.) et sais faire avancer des sujets complexes jusqu’à une exécution irréprochable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu combines créativité et esprit analytique, et sais naturellement transformer des insights en actions concrètes. Tu es à l’aise avec Excel et capable de prendre des décisions basées sur des données.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises le français et l’anglais, à l’oral comme à l’écrit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as une forte affinité pour l&#39;univers de l&#39;alimentaire et le goût des bonnes choses. Tu aimes mettre en valeur de façon authentique les bons produits, les producteurs et le terroir.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Avantages Picnic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍴 &lt;strong&gt;Restauration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comme nous sommes implantés au centre de Paris, pas de cantine sur place. Par contre, des tickets restaurant d’une valeur de 11€ par jour sont remis afin de tester tous les délicieux restaurants du coin. Notre petite cuisine est également équipée de savoureux en-cas et rafraîchissements.&lt;/p&gt;
